; selector, not a label: select_queue_params (stalker_combat_action_base.cpp) switches on it and
; case 8 forces queue 1 with a 3-4 s pause at EVERY range, so an NPC with a VSS fired one round
; at a time. The VSS is full-auto (fire_modes = 1, -1), exactly like the AS VAL, which is 6 and
; bursts correctly. 6 also lets it use suppressive fire (ai_stalker_fire.cpp:778 tests == 6) and
; drops the sniper 20 m stand-off (ai_stalker_cover.cpp). 6/7/8 stay one group for weapon
; preference, so this does not change what NPCs pick up.

